Shortcuts:
	Ctrl-O: Open a pdf document
	Ctrl-Q: Quit (preferences will be saved)
	Ctrl-F: Fullscreen
	Ctrl-P: Switch to Page mode (only the full pages are displayed)
	Ctrl-C: Switch to Case mode (a preview of each page will be displayed, followed by each case of the comics)
	Left: Go to previous case (to previous page in Page mode)
	Right: Go to next case (to next page in Page mode)
	Bottom: Go to previous page
	Top: Go to next page
